Error [E0212]: `values` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `result` is still looking into it
  --> returned_view_aggregate_blocks_owner_resize.jet:10:6
    |
 10 |     &values.push(4)
    |      ^^^^^^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
